<title>POLAND: FARM FOOD 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 8.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>FARM FOOD 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 8.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.22 vs   0.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.51 vs   0.24</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.13 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Sales		   18.43 vs  13.86</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.87 vs  11.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.43 vs  11.37</p>
<p> Operating profit    20.81 vs  17.55</p>
<p> Sales		  204.09 vs 155.28</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food producer is Farm Food SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
